============================================================================================
 (A)(B) THE 7 ODD POINTS = REGULAR HEPTAGON, symmetry D_7 (order 14)
============================================================================================
  vertices k=0..6 -> (2k+1)/14 = ['1/14', '3/14', '5/14', '1/2', '9/14', '11/14', '13/14']
  consecutive gaps = ['1/7', '1/7', '1/7', '1/7', '1/7', '1/7'] all = 1/7? True  => REGULAR HEPTAGON
  units (Z/14)* = [1, 3, 5, 9, 11, 13] (6 units) + center 7 (=7/14=1/2, the added vertex, NON-unit)
  MULT (Z/14)* = <x3> orbit: [1, 3, 9, 13, 11, 5] (C_6, fixes 7); ADD heptagon rotation = k->k+1 (+1/7).
  inversion iota (t->-t <=> a->14-a): 1<->13,3<->11,5<->9,7 fixed = reflection; a^-1 mod14: {1: 1, 3: 5, 5: 3, 9: 11, 11: 9, 13: 13}

