     base path 0..6 needs 1 in S: True; TILING: forward tiles gaps [2, 3], backward gaps [4, 5, 6] (15 tiles total across the staircase)
  PALEY C_7(1,2,4)=QR7: scores=[3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3] (regular? True); H(Ham paths)=189; c3=14; |Aut|=21; self-converse(=iota-inv/complement)? True
     base path 0..6 needs 1 in S: True; TILING: forward tiles gaps [2, 4], backward gaps [3, 5, 6] (15 tiles total across the staircase)
  Paley_7 H=189 is the n=7 MAXIMUM (project canon). Both are SELF-CONVERSE => iota-invariant => the
